    "description": "The bad piggies are no match for your slingshots in Angry Birds Friends! Master the art of the slingshot and aim for 3-star glory in the eternally fresh classic Angry Birds game! \r\n\r\nCompete against the World in 30+ NEW levels every week! Or take your chances in the Star Cup as you go head-to-head against individual opponents!\r\n\r\nCompete with your friends, come out on top, and climb the leaderboards to become the BEST puzzle player in the World in one of the most exciting bird games out there! Use your slingshots to knock down the bad piggies and claim victory.\r\nPractice your slingshots, improve accuracy, and reach higher scores.\r\n\r\nWeekly Tournaments!\r\n\u2013 NEW Competitive Events Tournaments starting every Monday, Thursday, and Saturday!\r\n\u2013 Play 30+ NEW levels every week!\r\n\u2013 Challenge opponents and win to advance to higher leagues!\r\n\u2013 Take hold of the top position for amazing rewards!\r\n\u2013 Special Themed Tournaments every other week, featuring royal matches and the ultimate showdowns in the Masters Tournament! It never gets boring with fresh themes!\r\n- Aim your slingshots at the bad piggies to clear the levels.\r\n\r\nStar Cup Brawl Event!\r\n\u2013 Challenge other players one-on-one in this epic event!\r\n\u2013 Free Power Ups, Level Effects, and Special Slingshots on every level! The competition is fierce! \r\n\u2013 Collect Feathers to level up your birds and gain more scoring power!\r\n\u2013 Win streaks! Win multiple matches in a row to increase your Rewards!\r\n-  Master the slingshots to outsmart the bad piggies in each game.\r\n\r\nBlue\u2019s Tallest Tower Daily Event!\r\n\u2013 Smash through daily levels to achieve the target score.\r\n\u2013 Collect new materials to construct the tallest tower and earn bigger rewards!\r\n\r\nThis game is a perfect fit for classic puzzle players or if you want competitive events. Challenge the bad piggies with your powerful slingshot skills. This game combines classic Angry Birds puzzles with the thrill of head-to-head competition. Who of your friends has the best slingshot aim?\r\n\r\nPlay the ultimate test of your puzzle-solving skills, inspired by classic games and engaging challenges.\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t miss out on the action-packed fun of Angry Birds Friends! The unique slingshot mechanics make each game a thrilling experience. Dive into its puzzles for free and explore while enjoying some of the funniest slingshot games against bad piggies.\r\n\r\nIf you love puzzle games, this is the game for you! \r\n\r\n-----------------------------\r\n\r\nNeed some help? Visit our support pages, or send us a message! https://support.rovio.com/\r\nLike us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/angrybirdsfriends/\r\n\r\n-----------------------------\r\n\r\nAngry Birds Friends is completely free to play, but there are optional in-app purchases available.\r\n\r\nWe may update the game periodically, for example to add new features or content or to fix bugs or other technical issues. Please note that the game may not function properly if you do not have the newest version installed. If you have not installed the latest update, Rovio will not be responsible for the game failing to function as expected.\r\n-----------------------------\r\nWhen playing this game, Rovio will offset the carbon footprint caused by the device\u2019s energy consumption.\r\n-----------------------------\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.rovio.com/terms-of-service\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.rovio.com/privacy",
